# This package holds the auditing infrastructure: Spring Data Auditing
# configuration, AuditorAware implementation, and audit event listeners.
#
# Audit events are critical for the multi-tenant authorization model.
# All entity state changes (create, update, delete) are stamped with
# the active userId and timestamp via @CreatedBy / @LastModifiedBy.
#
# Reference: docs/security/AUTHORIZATION_MODEL.md §13 (Audit & Authorization Events)
